formatTest is test
formatTest purpose "Integers, strings of digits, and floating values are written as glibc writes them: flags, widths, precisions, lengths, `*`, `%n$`, exact digits rounded to even, %a, infinities and NaN"
formatTest verifies formatAll writesLikeGlibc
formatTest verifies decimalDigits exactDigits
formatTest verifies roundingMode nearestByDefault
formatTest verifies cursorNew readsInOrder
formatTest verifies cursorFree releasesCursor
formatTest verifies readWord readsWords
