wideModeTest is test
wideModeTest purpose "Wide mode keeps a character past 255 as an escape, pads and cuts %lc, %s, and %ls by characters, takes %c's byte as a character, and counts characters"
wideModeTest verifies formatAllAs writesWideCharacters
wideModeTest verifies addUnit escapesPastByte
